 d by Marissa’s jazzy and endearing renditions of Christmas favorites lik
 e “Santa Baby\,” “Winter Wonderland\,” and “Have Yourself A Merr
 y Little Christmas\,” along with beloved jazz standards.\nhttps://www.bs
 o.org/events/dec-12-tli-jazz-marissa-mulde\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: htt
 ps://pushpin.city/westernma/
