SUMMARY:TLI Jazz: Camille Thurman
LOCATION:Tanglewood\, 297 West St\, Lenox\, MA 01240
DESCRIPTION:Studio E\, Linde Center for Music and Learning\nCelebrate Valen
 tine's Day with an unforgettable evening of jazz featuring acclaimed saxop
 honist\, vocalist\, composer\, and multi-instrumentalist Camille Thurman. 
 A former member of the Jazz at Lincoln Center Orchestra and a two-time ASC
 AP Herb Alpert Young Jazz Composers Award winner\, Thurman has earned accl
 aim for her virtuosic saxophone playing\, expressive vocals\, and captivat
 ing stage presence. Hailed as one of today's most dynamic voices in jazz\,
  Thurman brings extraordinary artistry\, infectious energy\, and heartfelt
  expression to a program that honors the rich tradition of jazz while embr
 acing its vibrant future.\nhttps://www.bso.org/events/feb-12-13-tli-jazz-c
 amille-thurman\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.bso.org/events/feb-12-13-tli-jazz-camille-thurman
END:VEVENT
