SUMMARY:TLI Presents: Santiago Cañón-Valencia
LOCATION:Tanglewood\, 297 West St\, Lenox\, MA 01240
DESCRIPTION:Studio E\, Linde Center for Music and Learning\nCellist Santiag
 o Cañón-Valencia has emerged as one of the most exciting artists of his 
 generation. Named a BBC New Generation Artist and Silver Medalist and Audi
 ence Favorite at the International Tchaikovsky Competition\, he has also e
 arned top prizes at the Queen Elisabeth\, Carlos Prieto\, and Beijing Inte
 rnational competitions. Praised for his extraordinary virtuosity and expre
 ssive depth\, Cañón-Valencia brings a fresh\, compelling voice to belove
 d masterworks and contemporary repertoire.\nhttps://www.bso.org/events/feb
 -26-santiago-canon-valencia\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.ci
 ty/westernma/
URL:https://www.bso.org/events/feb-26-santiago-canon-valencia
